ally edges it on F1. IMPORTANT CAVEAT: arrival_run trained on the leaky 'observed' corpus (crop centered/sized on t0|t1, i.e. it saw the future perimeter's geometry during training) and has NEVER seen a t0-window crop -- the ONLY geometry this live pipeline can ever produce at forecast time (the future perimeter is, by definition, unknown). So every live prediction from this model is out-of-distribution relative to its own training. The measured t0-window numbers above already reflect that (they are not a surprise), but this is 'best available', not 'production-ready' -- represent it that way. The operating_point (floor=0.0, mult=0.9) is the VAL-selected connected-causal decode point; it did NOT clear the 0.50 precision floor during selection (feasible=False, val P=0.270/R=0.259) -- it's the best-F1 fallback point, not a precision-guaranteed one.","issued_at_utc":"2026-08-14 12:40:14.410886+00:00","valid_from_utc":"2026-08-14 00:00:00","valid_to_utc":"2026-08-15 00:00:00","wfigs_date_current_utc":"2026-08-14 12:22:52+00:00","pixel_size_m":30,"veg_source":"refreshed_d4","physics_source":"eikonal_fbfm40","history_n_dates":1,"degraded_history":true,"containment_pct":85,"acres_wfigs":2623.1821664661975}},{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[-100.34238,34.06988],[-100.34238,34.07015],[-100.34206,34.07015],[-100.34206,34.06988],[-100.34238,34.06988]]],[[[-100.34238,34.07068],[-100.34206,34.07068],[-100.34206,34.07041],[-100.34238,34.07041],[-100.34238,34.07068]]],[[[-100.34173,34.07122],[-100.34141,34.07122],[-100.34141,34.07095],[-100.34173,34.07095],[-100.34173,34.07122]]],[[[-100.34238,34.07095],[-100.34238,34.07122],[-100.34206,34.07122],[-100.34206,34.07095],[-100.34238,34.07095]]],[[[-100.34173,34.07446],[-100.34141,34.07446],[-100.34141,34.07419],[-100.34173,34.07419],[-100.34173,34.07446]]],[[[-100.34173,34.075],[-100.34141,34.075],[-100.34141,34.07473],[-100.34173,34.07473],[-100.34173,34.075]]],[[[-100.34173,34.07527],[-100.34173